H5618.def:
A man living at the time of Exile and Return, first mentioned at Esdras 2:55; also called Hassophereth at Esdras 2:55; 
§ Sophereth = "writing"
an ancestor of a family of exiles who returned with Zerubbabel

H5623.def:
A man living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 2 Rois 18:13; 
father of: Adrammelech (H0152H), Sharezer (H8272) and Esarhaddon (H0634); also called Sargon at Ésaïe 20:1;
Another name of san.che.riv (סַנְחֵרִיב "Sennacherib" H5576) 
§ Sargon = "prince of the sun"
king of Assyria, son of Shalmaneser, and father of Sennacherib; ruled from 721-702 BC; conqueror of Samaria

H5624.def:
A man of the tribe of Zebulun living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:14; 
son of: Zebulun (H2074); 
brother of: Elon (H0356H) and Jahleel (H3177)
Also named: sar.di (סַרְדִּי "Seredite" H5625) 
§ Sered = "fear"
the 1st son of Zebulun

H5625.def:
Someone descended from Sered who was a man of the tribe of Zebulun living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:14; 
son of: Zebulun (H2074); 
brother of: Elon (H0356H) and Jahleel (H3177)
Group of se.red (סֶ֫רֶד "Sered" H5624) 
§ Sardites, of Sered "fright"
descendants of Sered, the 1st born son of Zebulun

H5644.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at Exode 6:22; 
son of: Uzziel (H5816); 
brother of: Mishael (H4332), Elizaphan (H0469), Micah (H4318J) and Isshiah (H3449I) 
§ Zithri = "protection of Jehovah"
1) son of Uzziel and grandson of Kohath the son of Levi
1a) more properly 'Sithri'

H5653H.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Exile and Return, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 9:16; 
son of: Shemaiah (H8098F); also called Abda at Néhémie 11:17; 
Another name of o.vad.yah (עֹבַדְיָ֫הוּ "Obadiah" H5662K)
§ Abda = "servant of Jehovah"
1) father of Adoniram
2) a Levite, son of Shammua; also called 'Obadiah'

H5654.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 2 Samuel 6:10; 
son of: Jeduthun (H3038); 
brother of: Mattithiah (H4993H), Gedaliah (H1436I), Zeri (H6874), Jeshaiah (H3470H) and Hashabiah (H2811I); 
father of: Shemaiah (H8098I), Jehozabad (H3075H), Joah (H3098I), Sachar (H7940), Nethanel (H5417K), Ammiel (H5988I), Issachar (H3485H) and Peullethai (H6469)
Also named: shim.i (שִׁמְעִי "Shimei" H8096X) 
§ Obed-edom = "servant of Edom"
1) a Levite and a Gittite who kept the ark after Uzzah was slain by God for touching the ark while it was being taken to Jerusalem
2) a Merarite Levite and a singer and gatekeeper
2a) the family descended from him

H5658K.def:
A man living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 2 Rois 22:12; 
son of: Micaiah (H4320); 
father of: Elnathan (H0494K); also called Abdon at 2 Chroniques 34:20; 
Another name of akh.bor (עַכְבּוֹר "Achbor" H5907H)
§ Abdon = "servile"
1) a judge of Israel in the time of the judges; perhaps the same as 'Bedan'
2) a Benjamite, son of Shashak
3) a Gibeonite, son of Jehiel and a grandson of Gideon
4) son of Micah in the time of king Josiah of Judah; also 'Achbor'
5) a city in Asher allotted to the Gershonite Levites; located 10 miles (16 km) north of Accho; modern 'Abdeh'

H5661.def:
A man of the tribe of Gad living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 5:15; 
son of: Guni (H1476H); 
father of: Ahi (H0277) 
§ Abdiel = "servant of God"
a Gadite, son of Guni and father of Ahi and one who settled in the land of Bashan in the time of king Jotham of Judah

H5681.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 24:27; 
son of: Jaaziah (H3269); 
brother of: Beno (H1121B), Shoham (H7719) and Zaccur (H2139I) 
§ Ibri = "Hebrew"
a Merarite Levite of the family of Jaaziah in the time of David
